{
  "format": "orbital-economy-change-policy-v1",
  "name": "Orbital Economy v7.7.11 Population candidate r1 - change contract",
  "description": "Task 030 change contract from V7_7_11_ARCHITECTURE_SPEC.md. Accepted baseline: v7.7.10 r1. No switch and no new Mode: Modes 0-48 must reproduce it exactly; the only model change is the added accounting-only population layer. validation_sha256 retains the owner-draft value for the byte-identical validation candidate and is to be confirmed by candidate.yml.",
  "accepted_model_sha256": "3cb40c883703936af3550a82a731d4af17f3818afe80b69c0c8f92e0878ab903",
